   "speechStart": 5.998,
   "speechEnd": 7.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，Sui 上的 Cetus 被盗约 2.23 亿美元，根因是集中流动性合约的算术溢出。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，Sui 上的 Cetus 被盗约 2.23 亿美元，根因是集中流动性合约的算术溢出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.688,
   "dur": 8.016,
   "speechStart": 8.786,
   "speechEnd": 15.857
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "约 6300 万美元，在冻结前跨链到了以太坊。",
   "spoken": "约 6300 万美元，在冻结前跨链到了以太坊。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.924,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 17.022,
   "speechEnd": 20.914
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "Sui 验证者在链上冻结了约 1.62 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "Sui 验证者在链上冻结了约 1.62 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.968,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 22.066,
   "speechEnd": 25.339
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "治理投票以约 90.9% 的质押权通过，用协议升级，把冻结的钱转进三方共管的多签，用于赔付。",
   "spoken": "治理投票以约 90.9% 的质押权通过，用协议升级，把冻结的钱转进三方共管的多签，用于赔付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.412,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 26.51,
   "speechEnd": 34.2
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "钱保住了，争议也来了。",
   "spoken": "钱保住了，争议也来了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 35.272,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 35.37,
   "speechEnd": 37.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "部分验证者公开表达了保留意见。",
   "spoken": "部分验证者公开表达了保留意见。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.204,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 38.302,
   "speechEnd": 40.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "能冻结并改写特定地址，也就说明，这条链的验证者可以干预任意地址。",
   "spoken": "能冻结并改写特定地址，也就说明，这条链的验证者可以干预任意地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.76,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 41.858,
   "speechEnd": 47.667
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "Binance 事件里，Arbitrum 安全委员会也强制转走了，攻击者钱包里的 8426 ETH 和 7460 万 ARB。",
   "spoken": "Binance 事件里，Arbitrum 安全委员会也强制转走了，攻击者钱包里的 8426 ETH 和 7460 万 ARB。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.724,
   "dur": 9.168,
   "speechStart": 48.822,
   "speechEnd": 57.072
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "一条是谈判与白帽赎回。",
   "spoken": "一条是谈判与白帽赎回。",
